msgid "Delete all WP-Autoplugin data when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "Eliminar todos los datos de WP-Autoplugin al desinstalar el plugin"

#: src/V2/Admin/Settings_Page.php:138
msgid ""
"This removes settings and credentials, workspaces, plans, generated "
"revisions, reviews, usage history, prompt attachments, and release history. "
"Plugins and themes created or modified with WP-Autoplugin are not deleted or "
"reverted."
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina ajustes y credenciales, espacios de trabajo, planes, revisiones "
"generadas, análisis, historial de uso, adjuntos de instrucciones e historial "
"de publicaciones. Los plugins y temas creados o modificados con WP-"
"Autoplugin no se eliminan ni se revierten."

